  "featured_image": "http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Group1.jpg",
  "body_html": "<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Group1.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-6901\"><img alt=\"group1\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6901\" height=\"271\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Group1-300x271.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a></p>\n<p>A new rock/alternative band caught our attention recently. Based in Cyprus, they are named The smallest Creature and released their first single “Reboot” out of the full-length album whose name is yet to be announced. The group is the brainchild of its frontman, Stefanos Marnerides (guitar, vocals, songwriting) who once used the name as an alias in his years as a solo artist before being joined by longtime friends Iacovos Stylianides (drums) and Stephanos Nicolaou (bass). While recording the album the trio released the debut single as well as promoting another three – Copenhagen, Spring, and Enchanting.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/TsC_Sqr_Blck_Text.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-6900\"><img alt=\"tsc_sqr_blck_text\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6900\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/TsC_Sqr_Blck_Text-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a><br/>\nBits of nostalgia flow into me as the lead single plays by. It recalls me the days of good old-school rock – drums are distinct, rhythm is solid – two virtues I really appreciate. Guitars slowly imbue the melody, lyrics are sensible and graceful. Music is skillfully written, marvelous attention is paid to detail, and compositions appear to me dreamy and enchanting.<br/>\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HTw_2GA4YqY?feature=oembed\" width=\"560\"></iframe><br/>\nHaving the good chance to listen to some other tracks I got an instant favorite named as “Copenhagen” and can be found on Soundclud. It’s more like a ballad, a resonating one which I would give a couple more plays.<br/>\n<iframe frameborder=\"no\" height=\"400\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?visual=true&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fapi.soundcloud.com%2Ftracks%2F279840122&amp;show_artwork=true&amp;maxwidth=560&amp;maxheight=840\" width=\"560\"></iframe><br/>\nOn the other hand Enchanting is the most dynamic song out of the four bearing unique viral vibe. It’s awakening, just like these ones you would play to yourself during making decisive master-plans. It’s energetic, moving, rocking!</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Group2.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-6899\"><img alt=\"group2\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6899\" height=\"218\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Group2-300x218.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a></p>\n<p>We hope to see the whole album soon on Soundcloud and put it on repeat!</p>\n<p>Stay in touch with their updates by liking their <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ThesmallestCreature/\">facebook page</a>  and checking out their <a href=\"http://www.thesmallestcreature.com/\">website </a>regularly <img alt=\":)\" class=\"wp-smiley\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-includes/images/smilies/simple-smile.png\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\"/></p>\n<p><iframe frameborder=\"no\" height=\"450\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?visual=true&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fapi.soundcloud.com%2Fusers%2F16844770&amp;show_artwork=true&amp;maxwidth=560&amp;maxheight=840\" width=\"560\"></iframe></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Steph.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-6906\"><img alt=\"steph\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6906\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Steph-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Jack.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-6904\"><img alt=\"jack\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6904\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Jack-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Stef.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-6905\"><img alt=\"stef\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6905\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Stef-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/TsC_Wide_Wht.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-6902\"><img alt=\"tsc_wide_wht\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6902\" height=\"120\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/TsC_Wide_Wht-300x120.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>",
